      144  == Economy ==
      145  There are 12,555 businesses registered in the district. The share of agricultural land is 66,673 ha (74.7%) of total land area. The [[arable land]] occupies 52,161 ha (58.5%) of the total area of agricultural land: 2996 ha (3.4%), plantations of [[orchards]], 3826 ha (4.3%) of [[vineyards]], 4497 ha
      146  == Education ==
      147  The district Anenii Noi, 36 educational institutions operate. Total number of students: 10,867 students in schools, 120 children polyvalent [[vocational schools]].
      148  Currently the schools in the district operates 860 teachers.{{Citation needed|reason=Not in 2024 Census Data|date=February 2026}}
